<mxCell id="c839" value="1  konnectivity-agent (hosted kube-system) dials out to konnectivity-server; kube-apiserver uses the tunnel to reach kubelets, webhooks and aggregated APIs." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1049.8" width="967.0" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c840" value="2  Kubelets and in-cluster clients reach the hosted kube-apiserver through a MetalLB LoadBalancer VIP on 6443." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1066.8" width="683.6" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c841" value="3  New workers pull ignition from ignition-server when an Agent joins a NodePool." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1083.8" width="505.0" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c842" value="4  Argo CD applies HostedCluster/NodePool CRs on the management cluster, and tenant namespaces, quotas, RBAC and apps on each hosted cluster." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1100.8" width="874.6" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c843" value="5  The HyperShift operator turns each HostedCluster into a clusters-&lt;name&gt; namespace and deploys the control plane there." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1117.8" width="751.4" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c844" value="6  capi-provider-agent binds free Agents from hardware-inventory to a NodePool; they boot as workers of that hosted cluster." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Red Hat Text;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DRed%2BHat%2BText;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5a6575;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1134.8" width="769.8" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>